From: Michael Egner <m.egner@gmx.net>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:52:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] catalog-service-api: add optional sku to Product,
 Create/UpdateProductRequest and ProductUpdatedEvent

Adds optional string sku (field 13 on Product and ProductUpdatedEvent,
10/11 on Create/UpdateProductRequest with min_len 1 / max_len 64).
Bumps VERSION to 1.3.9. gen/ still needs regenerating via make generate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
